# Agent tooling and local notes: not project source. `.codebuddy/` holds
# installed skill packs and `.workbuddy/` holds per-project memory, both
# rewritten by the tooling on their own schedule — tracking either means a
# permanent stream of diffs that has nothing to do with an application change.
.codebuddy/
.workbuddy/

